# C++ / Toolbox style
- Follow surrounding repository style.
- Reuse ToolboxWindow, ToolboxModule, settings, logging, lifecycle, and ImGui patterns.
- Respect Initialize, Update, Draw, SignalTerminate, Terminate, LoadSettings, SaveSettings.
- Do not block render/update; no network calls in Draw/Update.
- Validate game pointers/state; prefer GWCA abstractions over direct memory access.
- Keep callbacks lightweight and unregister them on termination.
- Do not throw across game callback boundaries.
